haracteristics, CDC analyzed case report form data for probable or confirmed cases initially reported through July 22, 2022\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"to allow for reporting delay, data received through July 27 were included.\"}, {\"loc\": \"table 1\", \"q\": \"Percentages calculated using nonmissing data.\"}], \"confidence\": \"high\", \"uncertain_fields\": []}", "type": "text"}]}